          "id": "55b38fb5-0832-447c-8ef2-cc0d27021fdb",
          "name": "List Hubs",
          "request": {
            "name": "List Hubs",
            "description": {
              "content": "Returns a collection of hubs that the user of your app can access.\n\nThe returned hubs can be BIM 360 Team hubs, Fusion Team hubs (formerly known as A360 Team hubs), A360 Personal hubs, ACC Docs (Autodesk Docs) accounts, or BIM 360 Docs accounts. Only active hubs are returned.\n\nFor BIM 360 Docs and ACC Docs, a hub ID corresponds to an Account ID. To convert a BIM 360 or ACC Account ID to a hub ID, prefix the Account ID with ``b.``. For example, an Account ID of ```c8b0c73d-3ae9``` translates to a hub ID of ``b.c8b0c73d-3ae9``.\n\n**Note:** This operation supports Autodesk Construction Cloud (ACC) Projects. For more information, see the [ACC Platform API documentation](https://en.docs.acc.v1/overview/introduction/). ",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
